	(text "74HCT244: 3.3 V ESP32 logic in (VIH 2.0 V) -> 5 V logic out to the BTS7960B IN/INH.\n/1OE and /2OE tied low (always enabled). 10k pull-downs keep the bridges off while the ESP32 boots.\nUnused inputs 1A3/2A3 tied to GND, unused outputs left open."
